Task: 25
Title: Model-tier verification (haiku reviewers, sonnet orchestrators)
Phase: 4
Route: full
Slice: Slice 4b — Integration
Dependencies: 24
Scope: Validate that the agent type frontmatter correctly distinguishes model tiers: all stage orchestrator agents (11 agents) use sonnet-tier model (`anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-5`), all reviewer and leaf agents use haiku-tier model (`anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5`), and code-writing/verification agents use the tier specified in the design (medium-thinking agents use sonnet, low-thinking leaf agents use haiku). Write a validation script or test that verifies the `model` and `thinking` fields across all 55 agent `.md` files match the tier assignments documented in DEEPWORK.md and the agent type tables. Also verify that `qrspi_dispatch` gracefully handles absence of pi-subagents (fallback message test).
Acceptance Criteria: AC 7 (model tier assignment verified)
NFRs: NFR: Compatibility (model tier verification)
Gate Criteria: Phase 4 replan gate (Model tiers verified)
