  - test/model-tier-verification.test.ts (CREATE) — Programmatic validation: parse YAML frontmatter from all 55 agents/*.md files, verify model field matches expected tier per agent category table, verify thinking field matches design spec (low for reviewers, medium for code writers/verifiers)
